eting authorization requirement C0000.\",\"operation\":\"edit\",\"target\":\"C0002\",\"qualifies\":[\"C0000\"],\"quote\":\"A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\",\"fields\":{\"kind\":\"exception\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"except if the communication is in the form of:\"],\"scope_text\":\"except if the communication is in the form of:\",\"context_quotes\":[\"a covered entity must obtain an authorization for any use or disclosure of protected health information for marketing, except if the communication is in the form of:\",\"(B) A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\"],\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"A face-to-face communication made by a covered entity to an individual\",\"A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(A) A face-to-face communication made by a covered entity to an individual; or\\n\\n(B) A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\",\"choice_text\":\"A face-to-face communication made by a covered entity to an individual; or A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\",\"logic_text\":\"except if the communication is in the form of: (B) A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity.\",\"actor_quote\":\"the covered entity\",\"actor\":\"covered entity\",\"action_quote\":\"provided by the covered entity\",\"action\":\"provide a promotional gift of nominal value\",\"object_quote\":\"A promotional gift of nominal value\",\"object\":\"promotional gift of nominal value\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"relation\":\"exception\",\"references\":[],\"summary\":\"Excepts marketing communications in the form of a promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity from the authorization requirement.\"}}],\"observations\":[{\"quote\":\"other than the transition provisions in § 164.532\",\"rationale\":\"Carves out the transition provisions in § 164.532 from the subpart-wide non-obstante clause; the referenced target rule is remote and not present in the local draft.\",\"disposition\":\"unresolved\"},{\"quote\":\"If the marketing involves financial remuneration, as defined in paragraph (3) of the definition of marketing at § 164.501, to the covered entity from a third party,\",\"rationale\":\"This condition is already represented in the scope_text and logic_text of requirement C0003.\",\"disposition\":\"already_represented\"},{\"quote\":\"nominal value\",\"rationale\":\"The threshold qualification of nominal value is already fully incorporated in promotional gift exception C0002.\",\"disposition\":\"already_represented\"}]}",
